*SPICE Netlist for the given schematic

Q1 6 4 3 NPN * BJT Transistor: (Collector -> Base -> Emitter)
RFC 8 7 1uH * RFC Inductor with arbitrary value of 1uH
C1 2 0 10uF * Capacitor C1: Node 2 to Ground
