RB1 5 4 1k * Resistor RB1: Node 5 to Node 4
RB2 4 0 1k * Resistor RB2: Node 4 to Ground
RL 2 3 1k * Resistor RL: Node 2 to Node 3
VCC 8 0 DC 12V * DC Voltage Source: Node 8 to Ground

